# Email Configuration for Five Matrix Shipping Contact Form
# Choose ANY ONE of the following 3 options and add the keys in your hosting provider (e.g. Vercel / Netlify / .env.local):

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Web3Forms (FASTEST & EASIEST - 100% Free, No DNS setup)
# 1. Visit: https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your email: info@fivematrixship.com
# 3. Check inbox for your Access Key and paste below:
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: SMTP / Company Email (Google Workspace / Zoho / Hostinger / cPanel / Titan)
# If info@fivematrixship.com is hosted on an email service:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.titan.email (or smtp.gmail.com / mail.fivematrixship.com)
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_SECURE=true
# SMTP_USER=info@fivematrixship.com
# SMTP_PASS=your_email_password
# SMTP_FROM="Five Matrix Shipping <info@fivematrixship.com>"

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 3: Resend API
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com
# 2. Add domain fivematrixship.com and generate an API key:
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=info@fivematrixship.com
